  targetType: 
  description: CryoNodes originated from cryogenic stasis research conducted on deep-space
    vessels. Their purpose was to halt biological processes indefinitely during interstellar
    travel. When containment breaches became common, researchers adapted the technology
    for emergency suppression. What was once meant to preserve life is now used to
    immobilize it.
  vnDescription: "CryoNodes b\u1EAFt ngu\u1ED3n t\u1EEB nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u v\u1EC1
    tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i ng\u1EE7 \u0111\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p \u0111\xF4ng
    l\u1EA1nh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n tr\xEAn c\xE1c t\xE0u v\u0169
    tr\u1EE5 th\xE1m hi\u1EC3m kh\xF4ng gian s\xE2u. M\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch c\u1EE7a
    ch\xFAng l\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng c\xE1c qu\xE1 tr\xECnh sinh h\u1ECDc
    v\xF4 th\u1EDDi h\u1EA1n trong su\u1ED1t h\xE0nh tr\xECnh gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c v\xEC
    sao. Khi c\xE1c s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1 r\xF2 r\u1EC9 tr\u1EDF n\xEAn ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn,
    c\xE1c nh\xE0 nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u \u0111\xE3 \u0111i\u1EC1u ch\u1EC9nh c\xF4ng
    ngh\u1EC7 n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng cho vi\u1EC7c ng\u0103n ch\u1EB7n
    s\u1EF1 s\u1ED1ng trong tr\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1EE3p kh\u1EA9n c\u1EA5p. Th\u1EE9
    t\u1EEBng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA3o t\u1ED3n s\u1EF1
    s\u1ED1ng gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE2y l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng
    \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9ng n\xF3."
